# Standard Python Ignores
# ==========================================

# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Pytest caches
.pytest_cache/

# Virtual Environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ==========================================
# IDE & OS Specific
# ==========================================

# VS Code / JetBrains
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

